abstract: >-
  A verified pre-silicon Tiny Tapeout design for studying configurable
  electrical realizations of logic, with fixed reference paths, ring
  oscillators, and an on-chip time-to-digital converter. The design was not
  submitted for fabrication, so its results are limited to simulation and
  physical-design verification.
